---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GeometricVisual from '../components/GeometricVisual.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='wo/men in tech · women in technical'
  description='面向技术与创造领域女性的慢节奏社群。在商业项目之外，做一些纯粹的事。'
  width='reading'
>
  <div class='page-root'>
    <div class='two-column-layout'>

      {/* ===== 左侧：品牌与宣言 ===== */}
      <aside class='sidebar' id='about'>

        <div class='brand-group'>
          <h1 class='site-title'>wo<span class='brand-slash'>/</span>men</h1>
          <p class='site-sub'>women in technical</p>
          <p class='site-zh'>"我们"</p>
        </div>

        <div class='manifesto'>
          <p>
            在每一个商业项目的空隙里，<br />
            总有一些东西是做给自己的。
          </p>
          <p>
            这里是那个地方。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='sidebar-divider'></div>

        <div class='who-section'>
          <span class='who-label'>面向群体</span>
          <p class='who-desc'>
            所有在技术与创造领域工作的女性——<br />
            产品、设计、工程、研究、写作……
          </p>
          <p class='who-note'>
            不需要特定头衔，<br />
            只是对作品本身有一点执念。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='sidebar-footer'>
          <GeometricVisual type='subtle' height='72px' />
        </div>
      </aside>

      {/* ===== 右侧：核心展陈区 ===== */}
      <main class='content-main'>

        {/* 1. 我们做什么 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='events'>
          <div class='section-heading-group'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>01</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>日常与创作机制</h2>
              <span class='section-en-tag'>WHAT WE DO</span>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>在商业流水线之外，守住纯粹的手艺与思考。</p>
          </div>

          <div class='editorial-panels-stack'>
            {/* 项目 01 */}
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>01</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Coffee Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>双周 · 线上 / 杭州</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                不是 networking。<br />
                两三个人，把手里的咖啡喝完，谈谈最近在做的事——或者什么也不谈。
              </p>
            </article>

            {/* 项目 02 */}
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>02</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>English Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>双周 · 线上不定期</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                用英语聊产品、设计或技术。<br />
                一个不被评判的地方练习表达，没有标准答案，只有真实的体悟。
              </p>
            </article>

            {/* 项目 03 */}
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>03</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>作品 · Lab</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>小组制 · 慢工出细活</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                把那个一直在脑子里转的想法拿出来，找到懂你的人一起慢慢打磨。<br />
                不赶 deadline，不做为了证明什么的交付，只做值得的事。
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class='section-footer-link'>
            <a href='/events' class='quiet-text-link'>
              <span>阅读完整手艺准则与共建机制</span>
              <span class='link-arrow'>→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 2. 近期安排 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='schedule'>
          <div class='section-heading-group'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>02</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>近期安排</h2>
              <span class='section-en-tag'>UPCOMING</span>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>小规模交流，确保每一次相聚都有充裕的聆听与表达。</p>
          </div>

          <div class='editorial-panels-stack'>
            {/* 近期 01 */}
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>01</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>AI 时代，还剩下什么是属于自己的？</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>开放预约</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                探讨如何从工业流水线的焦虑中抽离，重新发现具有个人辨识度的表达。
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>形式：杭州线下静谧小店 + 线上同步</span>
                <span>双周周末 · 3-5 人</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            {/* 近期 02 */}
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>02</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Show & Tell: Walk Me Through Something You Made</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>开放预约</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                每人 5 分钟用英文讲述一个喜欢的界面细节、动效或代码架构，安全试错。
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>形式：线上视频室 · 40 min</span>
                <span>双周周中晚间</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class='section-footer-link'>
            <a href='/upcoming' class='quiet-text-link'>
              <span>查看全部排期与答疑</span>
              <span class='link-arrow'>→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 3. 预约加入 (前置极细金线手作表单) */}
        <section class='content-block' id='join'>
          <div class='section-heading-group'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>03</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>预约交流 · 加入“我们”</h2>
              <span class='section-en-tag'>JOIN THE CIRCLE</span>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>如果你有共鸣，欢迎随时留下你的声音。没有评判与考核。</p>
          </div>

          <div class='form-wrapper'>
            <form id='home-join-form' class='quiet-form'>

              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label' for='home-name'>
                  <span>如何称呼你</span>
                  <span class='field-hint'>Name / Nickname</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  type='text'
                  id='home-name'
                  name='name'
                  placeholder='名字或习惯的称呼'
                  required
                  autocomplete='off'
                />
              </div>

              {/* 前置细金线单选 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label'>
                  <span>你在从事的领域</span>
                  <span class='field-hint'>单选</span>
                </label>
                <div class='quiet-check-list' role='radiogroup' aria-label='从事领域'>
                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='design' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title'>设计 · 视觉传达 / 交互体验 (IxD)</span>
                      <span class='check-note'>视觉、触感与动效</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='product' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title'>产品 · 逻辑推敲 / 独立孵化 (PM)</span>
                      <span class='check-note'>痛点挖掘与体验闭环</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='engineering' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title'>工程 · 前端架构 / 独立全栈 (FE)</span>
                      <span class='check-note'>代码实现与鲁棒工程</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='other' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title'>研究 / 写作 / 自由创造者</span>
                      <span class='check-note'>深度观察与跨界表达</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              {/* 前置细金线多选 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label'>
                  <span>想参与的活动</span>
                  <span class='field-hint'>多选</span>
                </label>
                <div class='quiet-check-list'>
                  <label class='quiet-check-row'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='coffee_chat' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                      <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title'>☕ Offline & Online Coffee Chat</span>
                      <span class='check-note'>双周轻聚 · 低压真诚</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='english_chat' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                      <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title'>🗣️ English Tech & Design Chat</span>
                      <span class='check-note'>双周线上 · 5 min Show & Tell</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='portfolio_building' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                      <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title'>🛠️ 作品 Lab · 慢工出细活</span>
                      <span class='check-note'>经验互借 · 代表作打磨</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label' for='home-idea'>
                  <span>正在做的事，或者想交流的话题</span>
                  <span class='field-hint'>可留空</span>
                </label>
                <textarea
                  id='home-idea'
                  name='idea'
                  rows='2'
                  placeholder='一个未完成的作品，一个还没找到人聊的想法……'
                ></textarea>
              </div>

              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label' for='home-contact'>
                  <span>联系方式</span>
                  <span class='field-hint'>微信号或邮箱 · 仅用于活动邀请</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  type='text'
                  id='home-contact'
                  name='contact'
                  placeholder='微信号或 Email'
                  required
                  autocomplete='off'
                />
              </div>

              <div class='submit-zone'>
                <button type='submit' class='submit-btn-primary' id='home-submit-btn'>
                  <span>留下联系方式</span>
                  <span class='btn-arrow'>→</span>
                </button>
                <span class='privacy-reassurance'>
                  随时可退订联系 · 不作商业营销
                </span>
              </div>

              <div id='home-form-feedback' style='display: none;'>
                <div class='feedback-receipt-box'>
                  <div class='receipt-head'>
                    <span class='receipt-icon'>✦</span>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class='receipt-msg-title'>收到了。</h4>
                      <p class='receipt-id-tag' id='home-receipt-id'>回执编号: WT-PENDING</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <p class='receipt-note'>意向已保存在社群记录中，我们会在下次活动前联系你。</p>
                </div>
              </div>

            </form>
          </div>
        </section>

      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('home-join-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const feedback = document.getElementById('home-form-feedback');
  const submitBtn = document.getElementById('home-submit-btn');
  const receiptDisplay = document.getElementById('home-receipt-id');

  if (form && feedback) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const formData = new FormData(form);
      const payload = {
        name: formData.get('name'),
        craft: formData.get('craft'),
        interests: formData.getAll('interests'),
        idea: formData.get('idea'),
        contact: formData.get('contact'),
        clientTimestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
      };

      // 备份到本地存储
      try {
        const existing = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wotech_rsvp_backup') || '[]');
        existing.push(payload);
        localStorage.setItem('wotech_rsvp_backup', JSON.stringify(existing));
      } catch (err) {}

      // 发送至 API
      let subId = `WT-${Date.now().toString(36).slice(-5).toUpperCase()}`;
      try {
        if (submitBtn) submitBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');
        const res = await fetch('/api/join', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });
        if (res.ok) {
          const resData = await res.json();
          if (resData.submissionId) subId = resData.submissionId;
        }
      } catch (err) {}

      if (receiptDisplay) receiptDisplay.textContent = `回执编号: #${subId}`;
      feedback.style.display = 'block';
      if (submitBtn) submitBtn.style.display = 'none';
      feedback.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .page-root {
    padding: var(--spacing-6) 0 var(--spacing-24);
  }

  .two-column-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2.2fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-16);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--spacing-8);
    padding-right: var(--spacing-8);
    border-right: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-divider);
  }

  .brand-group {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .site-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-4xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-2);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    border-bottom: none !important;
  }

  .site-title .brand-slash {
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .site-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    text-transform: lowercase;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .site-zh {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .manifesto {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .manifesto p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .manifesto p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
  }

  .sidebar-divider {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.4;
    margin: var(--spacing-8) 0;
  }

  .who-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .who-label {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .who-desc {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .who-note {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .sidebar-footer {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-12);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* 右侧内容区 */
  .content-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-16);
  }

  .content-block {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ===== 章节统一标题头组 (Editorial Heading Group) ===== */
  .section-heading-group {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .section-title-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .section-serial {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
  }

  .section-main-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-en-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .section-intro-text {
    font-family: var(--font-family-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: var(--line-height-normal);
  }

  /* ===== 出版级图文面板 (Editorial Panels) ===== */
  .editorial-panels-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .editorial-panel {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--spacing-5) var(--spacing-6);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(38, 34, 28, 0.02);
    transition:
      border-color var(--transition-fast),
      transform var(--transition-fast),
      box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .editorial-panel:hover {
    border-color: rgba(216, 205, 176, 0.6);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(216, 205, 176, 0.08);
  }

  .panel-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .panel-name-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .panel-index {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
  }

  .panel-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .panel-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    background: var(--color-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider);
    padding: 1px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .panel-badge.status-open {
    color: #436956;
    border-color: rgba(196, 214, 204, 0.5);
    background: rgba(196, 214, 204, 0.15);
  }

  .panel-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-family-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .panel-footer-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-3);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-3);
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  /* 章节底部跳转链接 */
  .section-footer-link {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-4);
    text-align: right;
  }

  .quiet-text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-text-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  .link-arrow {
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-text-link:hover .link-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  /* 表单区 */
